    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Conductor!</i></strong><i> You\u2019re back on the rails.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Route management is your responsibility. Passenger delivery \u2014 your priority.</i><br><i>Do not engage with unauthorized persons outside your protocol.</i><br><i>The city\u2019s changed while you were offline. Stay alert.\u00a0Good luck! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>End of dispatch.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/f9742cf7cf3ff34ebfcadb8337ebf9ba.poster.avif?t=1751283705\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/f9742cf7cf3ff34ebfcadb8337ebf9ba.webm?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/f9742cf7cf3ff34ebfcadb8337ebf9ba.mp4?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECHO RAILWAY</strong> is an adventure with non-linear storytelling, focused on exploration and narrative. It blends the routine of a tram conductor with detective elements and a touch of surreal retrofuturistic noir.\u00a0You\u2019re bound to the rails. Your story isn\u2019t.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong> \u2013 Even on rails, you choose your own path. Wander through a devastating retrofuturistic city, exploring its secrets, memories, and fading beauty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Variety</strong> \u2013 Be an efficient worker or an empathetic wanderer. Choose your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Story</strong> \u2013 Randomized events and branching choices make each journey unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Combat</strong> \u2013 Focus on narrative, exploration, and meaningful choices instead of violence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Every action influences the outcome of your story \u2014 sometimes in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/6ec7770e7dc09a648c84bb265754763a.poster.avif?t=1751283705\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/6ec7770e7dc09a648c84bb265754763a.webm?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/6ec7770e7dc09a648c84bb265754763a.mp4?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your new home awaits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the late 21st century, as hopes for Earth\u2019s bright future faded, humanity launched the Great Exodus \u2014 a program to build spaceships for the best people to search for new life elsewhere. The ships were initially intended for all, but the elite were the first to depart, leaving others behind on a dying Earth, waiting for their turn. All remaining resources were dedicated to this, while other assets were reassessed, repurposed, or scrapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The audit was simple: prove you're still useful, or be scrapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a forgotten tram and its old conductor, the clock starts now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/88df07447a59479a6d115227fd52e590.poster.avif?t=1751283705\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/88df07447a59479a6d115227fd52e590.webm?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/88df07447a59479a6d115227fd52e590.mp4?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Conductor!</i></strong><i> You\u2019re back on the rails.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Route management is your responsibility. Passenger delivery \u2014 your priority.</i><br><i>Do not engage with unauthorized persons outside your protocol.</i><br><i>The city\u2019s changed while you were offline. Stay alert.\u00a0Good luck! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>End of dispatch.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/f9742cf7cf3ff34ebfcadb8337ebf9ba.poster.avif?t=1751283705\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/f9742cf7cf3ff34ebfcadb8337ebf9ba.webm?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/f9742cf7cf3ff34ebfcadb8337ebf9ba.mp4?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECHO RAILWAY</strong> is an adventure with non-linear storytelling, focused on exploration and narrative. It blends the routine of a tram conductor with detective elements and a touch of surreal retrofuturistic noir.\u00a0You\u2019re bound to the rails. Your story isn\u2019t.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong> \u2013 Even on rails, you choose your own path. Wander through a devastating retrofuturistic city, exploring its secrets, memories, and fading beauty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Variety</strong> \u2013 Be an efficient worker or an empathetic wanderer. Choose your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Story</strong> \u2013 Randomized events and branching choices make each journey unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Combat</strong> \u2013 Focus on narrative, exploration, and meaningful choices instead of violence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Every action influences the outcome of your story \u2014 sometimes in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/6ec7770e7dc09a648c84bb265754763a.poster.avif?t=1751283705\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/6ec7770e7dc09a648c84bb265754763a.webm?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/6ec7770e7dc09a648c84bb265754763a.mp4?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your new home awaits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the late 21st century, as hopes for Earth\u2019s bright future faded, humanity launched the Great Exodus \u2014 a program to build spaceships for the best people to search for new life elsewhere. The ships were initially intended for all, but the elite were the first to depart, leaving others behind on a dying Earth, waiting for their turn. All remaining resources were dedicated to this, while other assets were reassessed, repurposed, or scrapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The audit was simple: prove you're still useful, or be scrapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a forgotten tram and its old conductor, the clock starts now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/88df07447a59479a6d115227fd52e590.poster.avif?t=1751283705\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/88df07447a59479a6d115227fd52e590.webm?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657150/extras/88df07447a59479a6d115227fd52e590.mp4?t=1751283705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
